<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post248396985874361967..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: How the State&#39;s &quot;Justice&quot; System Cultivates Predators like Ibn Hunter </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>17</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5036979674139513085</id><published>2016-04-15T13:38:02.919-06:00</published><updated>2016-04-15T13:38:02.919-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Interestingly enough, the rise in the chart corres...</title><content type='html'>Interestingly enough, the rise in the chart corresponds with the civil rights movement and its &amp;quot;aftermath&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/5036979674139513085'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/5036979674139513085'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1460749082919#c5036979674139513085' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1767584328"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 15, 2016 at 1:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2317307707064097367</id><published>2015-11-24T05:00:11.960-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-24T05:00:11.960-07:00</updated><title type='text'>He should get life in prison.</title><content type='html'>He should get life in prison.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2317307707064097367'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2317307707064097367'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1448366411960#c2317307707064097367' title=''/><author><name>Paul Deane</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12582996599447899703</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-395431197"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 24, 2015 at 5:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5218019319431104324</id><published>2015-11-12T18:53:40.065-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-12T18:53:40.065-07:00</updated><title type='text'>What practical and achievable measures need to be ...</title><content type='html'>What practical and achievable measures need to be taken first? I see a grand objective but little in the way of practical solutions. If you could if you could flesh out additional measures that we can do then that would be great.&lt;br /&gt;Well written article. Worth the read. Pity the 1st 2 commenters didn&amp;#39;t bother. A lot of good points about what is wrong. Now lets fix it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/5218019319431104324'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/5218019319431104324'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1447379620065#c5218019319431104324' title=''/><author><name>Bernardson</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-470891588"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2015 at 6:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3758835799365389107</id><published>2015-11-12T11:21:49.443-07:00</published><updated>2015-11-12T11:21:49.443-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for writing this, Will. &#xa;&#xa;Lately, I&amp;#39;ve ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for writing this, Will. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lately, I&amp;#39;ve been oscillating between being a supporter of the police and FBI and being more Libertarian. I really do think there are some crazy, anti-cop types out there, but I am also deeply concerned with very real police abuse. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This article does more than cover the story of a criminal like Hunter, it provides a very good thought experiment as to what we can do to reform our criminal justice system: focus on the harm done to the individual rather than &amp;quot;society.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hope we can seriously work towards serious reform of our law-enforcement. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks, Will!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3758835799365389107'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3758835799365389107'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1447352509443#c3758835799365389107' title=''/><author><name>MisesMat</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03070675924349359934</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='20' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-JQZ4rTlw_lM/UB8u13XSwJI/AAAAAAAAAAU/yO6TEpTbFeE/s220/mencken7.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-132291385"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2015 at 11:21 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-255863512589277952</id><published>2015-10-22T21:50:27.530-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-22T21:50:27.530-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;ve always been puzzled at how the State in i...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;ve always been puzzled at how the State in its fevered thinking, and that&amp;#39;s being generous, would fine someone some ridiculous amount of.money.and then lock them up at great expense in order that said individual is now in capable of paying anyone anything!  If that&amp;#39;s not the definition of insanity then I don&amp;#39;t know what is. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/255863512589277952'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/255863512589277952'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445572227530#c255863512589277952' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1723579440"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 22, 2015 at 9:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3925441115927622955</id><published>2015-10-22T17:01:07.813-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-22T17:01:07.813-06:00</updated><title type='text'>And to think 100 years ago, justice would have bee...</title><content type='html'>And to think 100 years ago, justice would have been served up on the spot by real men, would have broken his neck and had him buried and not bothering the sheriff of the town. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3925441115927622955'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3925441115927622955'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445554867813#c3925441115927622955' title=''/><author><name>herbielina</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12457841051587632157</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-i19jEa_ZT0o/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABo/60_s059rtlA/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-989331874"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 22, 2015 at 5:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3878419415937892213</id><published>2015-10-20T17:35:36.144-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T17:35:36.144-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Justice requires desert, not restitution as part o...</title><content type='html'>Justice requires desert, not restitution as part or whole&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.angelfire.com/pro/lewiscs/humanitarian.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Which goes even further as Lewis is even more horrified at substituting deterrence or rehabilitation for the deserved punishment.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3878419415937892213'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/3878419415937892213'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445384136144#c3878419415937892213' title=''/><author><name>tz</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14446437456939115403</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_F0DRJg2NK8o/Ss1Hx9sb1cI/AAAAAAAAANs/4WtQjtj4hWU/S220/tzmin64x64.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1275847194"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 5:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6417725090543752582</id><published>2015-10-20T14:59:36.868-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T14:59:36.868-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The way these dirty, low life scum whine, jump up ...</title><content type='html'>The way these dirty, low life scum whine, jump up an down and throw hissy fits at the mere mention of cutting off their supply of toys is nauseating enough. I cannot imagine the howls of despair should we attempt to hold them the least bit accountable for their crimes against the humanity they are supposed to protect and serve. Ha!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/6417725090543752582'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/6417725090543752582'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445374776868#c6417725090543752582' title=''/><author><name>Bill in IL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1910257960"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 2:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7824776654012496190</id><published>2015-10-20T13:21:00.338-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T13:21:00.338-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When a criminal is charged by the &amp;quot;state&amp;quot...</title><content type='html'>&lt;br /&gt;When a criminal is charged by the &amp;quot;state&amp;quot; and a fine is imposed, and a true victim is involved, why is it that the funds from the fine are not forwarded to the victim?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Oh, right, because it is the State that has been offended and the real victim is just an afterthought.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Great essay, Will.  Always appreciate your good work.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/7824776654012496190'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/7824776654012496190'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445368860338#c7824776654012496190' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-787576208"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 1:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-191217604481579631</id><published>2015-10-20T11:25:11.361-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T11:25:11.361-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Here is his facebook https://m.facebook.com/Buckyo...</title><content type='html'>Here is his facebook https://m.facebook.com/Buckyoffhishumpfrey?pn_ref=friends_search</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/191217604481579631'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/191217604481579631'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445361911361#c191217604481579631' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1906772549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 11:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1313819736877545038</id><published>2015-10-20T10:59:02.803-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T10:59:02.803-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I actually read your whole article, and I ag...</title><content type='html'>Will, I actually read your whole article, and I agree with you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Government has its priorities backwards when it goes after nonviolent drug users instead of thugs like this.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And restitution to the victim should be more important than the criminal penalty against the offender.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/1313819736877545038'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/1313819736877545038'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445360342803#c1313819736877545038' title=''/><author><name>Lee Killough</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1587602928"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 10:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2483941800441155599</id><published>2015-10-20T09:42:11.534-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T09:42:11.534-06:00</updated><title type='text'>As is usually the case, Will, you made a better re...</title><content type='html'>As is usually the case, Will, you made a better response than I would have, before I did.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2483941800441155599'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2483941800441155599'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445355731534#c2483941800441155599' title=''/><author><name>Jim O&#39;Connor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15669445908177529235</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1294524732"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 9:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-609701281825085536</id><published>2015-10-20T09:22:53.868-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T09:22:53.868-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article William.  Amazing how everyone stand...</title><content type='html'>Great article William.  Amazing how everyone stands around in that video like they are watching a TV show.  I guess the reason the state and its media minions don&amp;#39;t like old school dads (who teach their kids to behave) is because they cut down the profits for the criminal justice system.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/609701281825085536'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/609701281825085536'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445354573868#c609701281825085536' title=''/><author><name>David</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03794290862834348358</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-548052506"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 9:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8690247067800890306</id><published>2015-10-20T08:56:57.222-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T08:56:57.222-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hello, Ryan Kelly -- do you perchance know Mr. Ano...</title><content type='html'>Hello, Ryan Kelly -- do you perchance know Mr. Anonymous? I suspect that you do. If not, it&amp;#39;s a tragic coincidence that you share his insuperable handicap with respect to reading comprehension, or perhaps his lamentably brief attention span.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;There is a reason why nobody pays any attention to articles like this but I doubt the writer will ever figure it out.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You certainly paid what little attention you could afford to the piece, even though you couldn&amp;#39;t trouble yourself to read it -- or, more likely, have it read to you. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To spare you the unfamiliar agony of actually reading and following an argument before opining on its merits, I&amp;#39;ll summarize what I wrote:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The hideous crime committed by the depraved, feral, despicable being named Ibn Hunter underscores the utter failure of the government&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;justice&amp;quot; system in deterring such acts, or providing restitution to victims of the same. This is because the system is structured to profit from violent crime, and to ignore the victims thereof.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Not being a cultural Marxist, I reject entirely the pernicious concept of &amp;quot;hate crimes,&amp;quot; which exacerbate the problem I describe above by treating &amp;quot;justice&amp;quot; in collectivist terms. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/8690247067800890306'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/8690247067800890306'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445353017222#c8690247067800890306' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 8:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2480929063874898641</id><published>2015-10-20T08:44:37.274-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T08:44:37.274-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It is disgusting that somebody would find a way to...</title><content type='html'> &lt;i&gt;It is disgusting that somebody would find a way to excuse this kids actions and find a way to blame it on the &amp;quot;white man&amp;quot;. &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I wholeheartedly agree that this would be disgusting -- nearly as disgusting, in fact, as imputing that opinion to me without actually reading the essay above. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Take the few minutes necessary to read beyond the headline, and then see if you can express an opinion on its merits, rather than emitting a bulimic recital of race-obsessed talking points. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2480929063874898641'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/2480929063874898641'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445352277274#c2480929063874898641' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 8:44 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1698520072289282281</id><published>2015-10-20T08:16:58.666-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T08:16:58.666-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another example of somebody blaming a black man&amp;#3...</title><content type='html'>Another example of somebody blaming a black man&amp;#39;s actions on the &amp;quot;white man&amp;quot;.  What this kid did was a hate crime but nobody will call it for what it is because&lt;br /&gt;A) the perpetrator was not white enough&lt;br /&gt;B) the victim was a woman and apparently it&amp;#39;s not hateful enough for a helpless woman to be knocked out for minding her business.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is a reason why nobody pays any attention to articles like this but I doubt the writer will ever figure it out.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maybe if BLM actually did something besides pumping the &amp;quot;kill all whiteys&amp;quot; mentality into the youth this crap wouldn&amp;#39;t happen.  BLM had a chance to be heard and actually help promote change in black society and change in white peoples mentality but they fucked it up by encouraging even more racism and they set black people back decades in the process.  Great Job!  Now white people and black people hate each other more than ever and nobody listens even when the wolf comes.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/1698520072289282281'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/1698520072289282281'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445350618666#c1698520072289282281' title=''/><author><name>Ryan Kelly</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01008596311484100655</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2068958262"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 8:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6783498932694725181</id><published>2015-10-20T08:05:01.538-06:00</published><updated>2015-10-20T08:05:01.538-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Are you kidding me?  This MF committed a hate crim...</title><content type='html'>Are you kidding me?  This MF committed a hate crime. (yes it was a hate crime because he stated he did that because she was a &amp;quot;bitch&amp;quot; and it most likely was racially motivated since BLM has every black youth in America thinking &amp;quot;kill whitey&amp;quot;.) It is disgusting that somebody would find a way to excuse this kids actions and find a way to blame it on the &amp;quot;white man&amp;quot;.  People who write this bullshit are fanning the flames to this race war crap we have going on the US and they are only setting black people back by decades.  There is a reason why nobody is even commenting on this crap anymore but I doubt the writer of this piece will ever figure it out.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/6783498932694725181'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/248396985874361967/comments/default/6783498932694725181'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html?showComment=1445349901538#c6783498932694725181' title=''/><author><name>Unknown</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01008596311484100655</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/10/how-states-justice-system-cultivates.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-248396985874361967' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/248396985874361967' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2068958262"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 20, 2015 at 8:05 AM"/></entry></feed>